config SIGMA_DUT
    bool "Enable WFA Sigma-DUT CAPI Agent"
    depends on WIFI6 && COMPONENTS_LWIP_ENABLE
    default n
    help
      Enable the WFA sigma-dut CAPI agent (TCP port 9000) for
      Wi-Fi Alliance certification testing.

      The agent listens for CAPI commands from the WFA UCC test bed
      and translates them into WiFi stack API calls.
